<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 6	Feb 5	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  259.120     259.310     247.020    4.90 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.950     305.000     306.830   -0.61 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.970     157.370     158.970   -1.26 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.518	46.540	47.182   -1.41 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  425.120     420.700     419.180    1.42 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.755     140.110     141.685   -1.36 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.979	15.951	16.185   -1.27 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  209.630     210.120     212.430   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.858	 1.859	 1.888   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.566	 1.581   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.970     181.290     183.135   -0.64 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
